# --- build output ---------------------------------------------------------
# The Pi build script places its release binary here.
/build/bin/

# Bundles and installers, wherever they end up.
*.app/
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# A bare `go build` drops a binary named after the module in the repo root.
# Real Pi builds go to build/bin; Fyne packaging creates an ignored app bundle.
/glowpanel

# --- NOT ignored, deliberately --------------------------------------------
# build/appicon.png      source asset for Linux and macOS packaging
# FyneApp.toml           package metadata, including the stable bundle ID

# --- secrets --------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit the MQTT password. The app reads credentials from
# ~/.config/glowkitchen/glow.conf, which lives outside this repo at mode 600 on
# both the Pis and the Mac. This is a guard in case a copy is ever dropped here.
glow.conf
*.local.conf
.env
.env.*

# --- Go -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.prof
go.work
go.work.sum
/vendor/

# --- runtime --------------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- macOS ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- editors --------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
